SUMMARY:Panigiri of Afentis Christos (Transfiguration)\, Zakros
LOCATION:Zakros\, Crete (Lasithi)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Upper Zakros\, the village at the top of the Gorge of the Dead\, celebrates the Saviour on the evening of 6 August with several local musicians and a dinner ticket (15 euros\, 10 for children in 2025). Combine a morning at the Minoan palace and Kato Zakros beach with the glenti in the village square\; the road back to Sitia is an hour of bends.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lasithi/#zakros-panigiri-of-afentis-christos-transfiguration-zakros
